   "name": "Convai: Laya",
   "created": 1789707955,
   "expiration_date": null,
   "description": "Multilingual, non-autoregressive System 1 decision model. Give it a state (text, email, ticket, or JSON) and typed questions; it returns typed answers with mathematically calibrated probabilities in a single forward pass (33 ms) across 100+ languages. Trained with reinforcement learning against strictly proper scoring rules (RLCD), so reporting honest probabilities is the only way to maximise reward. It never generates text, so there is nothing to parse and nothing to hallucinate.",
